Z||000000||Haze_Performance||04-10-2001||07:36 PM||||Sorry - Aztek<BR>  <B>As much as most of you HATE the Pontiac Aztek, There is good news!!! The Aztek can contribute to our Fiero hobby. My buddy (He works as a manager at a Pontiac dealer in the body shop) called me today & said he had a gift for me. I stopped by and he handed me a nice new leather auto shift knob. (From  a totaled 2001 Astek. It fell off of the truck transport. OUCH!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> ) Its the same color as the Fiero grey , Its slightly smaller than the large stock T-handle found on Fieros. Its also slightly angled to fit the drivers hand. I LOVE IT!!! It fits without any mods... VERY COOL!!!  <P>I just thought I would pass on the news.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><BR>Happy Hobbying, <BR>Haze</B><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">   </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 04-10-2001).]||||reg||14
